 ## Results and compatibility
 
diff --git a/docs/bend2/knowledge-context-2026-09-29.md b/docs/bend2/knowledge-context-2026-09-29.md
index 0123d3e9..ddae835f 100644
--- a/docs/bend2/knowledge-context-2026-09-29.md
